; Messaging: Copyright
;
; The first byte is the attribute used for the whole message, followed by
; the text, which ends with a character that has bit 7 set. The character
; #CHR(60) is the copyright symbol and #CHR(58) is a full stop.
@label=Message_Copyright
t$9174 DEFB $47                                       ; Attribute:
                                                      ; #COLOUR(#PEEK(#PC)).
 $9175 DEFM "<1984 A:C:G: ALL RIGHTS RESERVE","D"+$80 ; "<1984 A:C:G: ALL
                                                      ; RIGHTS RESERVED"
